OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits manslaughter of
OL,4,A76-year-old
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted killing a
OL,7,F76-year-old near a train station in
OL,8,FBirmingham last year.
OL,10,FAlvin Callum died after he was found in
OL,11,Fa serious condition on Birchfield Road,
OL,12,FPerry Barr, on 23 October.
OL,14,FWest Midlands Police said an
OL,15,Finvestigation established he had been
OL,16,Fassaulted earlier near Perry Barr train
OL,17,Fstation.
