OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits manslaughter of
OL,4,A76-year-old
OL,5,
OL,6,FOmajuwa Scarlett, 31, of Nash Square,
OL,7,FPerry Barr, pleaded guilty to
OL,8,Fmanslaughter by reason of diminished
OL,9,Fresponsibility and will return to
OL,10,FBirmingham Crown Court on 8 January to
OL,11,Fbe sentenced.
